# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.defaultLocale.1.12.0.schema.json

PackageIdentifier: kaptanoguz.Kuzgun
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Carmine Paolino
PublisherUrl: https://paolino.me/
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/kaptanoguz/Kuzgun/issues
Author: Carmine Paolino
PackageName: Kuzgun
PackageUrl: https://github.com/kaptanoguz/Kuzgun
License: MIT
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/kaptanoguz/Kuzgun/blob/v@VERSION@/LICENSE
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Carmine Paolino
ShortDescription: A fast, lightweight, native WhatsApp client
Description: |-
  Kuzgun is a small, fast WhatsApp client with no browser engine. It links to your phone as a companion device and keeps your chats in an encrypted archive on your computer. It sends and receives messages, photos, videos, voice messages, stickers and polls, holds several WhatsApp numbers in one window, and takes custom colour themes.
  Kuzgun was previously called FastsApp. It is not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.
  It needs a graphics driver with OpenGL 2.1 or newer.
Moniker: kuzgun
Tags:
- chat
- messaging
- messenger
- whatsapp
- whatsapp-client
